on exitFrame me
  [  0] pushcons 0 .............................. <"MenuScreen">
  [  2] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <"MenuScreen">
  [  4] extcall 2 ............................... go("MenuScreen")
  [  6] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [  8] thebuiltin 1 ............................ <the frame>
  [ 10] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <the frame>
  [ 12] extcall 2 ............................... go(the frame)
  [ 14] ret
end
